<title>OMAN: Bank of Oman, Bahrain and Kuwait net up.</title>
<headline>Bank of Oman, Bahrain and Kuwait net up.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Million Omani rials unless stated, rounded)</p>
<p>    Net profit after taxation	   2.54    vs    2.15</p>
<p>    Net interest income		   6.73    vs    7.06</p>
<p>    Provisions				0.250   vs    0.350</p>
<p>Full name: Bank of Oman, Bahrain and Kuwait SAOG.</p>
<p>Note: The Muscat-based bank is 51 percent owned by Omani investors and 49 percent by the Bank of Bahrain and Kuwait, which is owned equally by financial institutions and investors in Bahrain and Kuwait.</p>
<p>The bank said it was distributing a 1.5 million rial cash dividend to shareholders.</p>
</text>
